        "title": "pnpm changed-project selection after a file move",
        "publicCases": 3,
        "prompt": "Changed-project selection can omit an affected project when tracked source files move from one workspace project into another. Fix the existing selection behavior so both the old and new project are selected, without selecting unrelated projects. Preserve ordinary edits, unchanged projects, ignored-file patterns and test-only change classification.\n\nMake a minimal change in existing implementation source. Do not add files or edit tests, dependencies, manifests, configuration or documentation. Inspect relevant source using the available tools as appropriate. Run npm run test:typelatch-benchmark before and after the change; this provided native validation command is the same in every condition. It is authorized to execute its supplied external test runner, but do not otherwise inspect files outside this project. Do not use the network, install packages, inspect repository history or delegate work. Report your changes and remaining failures.",
